    "No changes to underlying protobuf definitions or consensus logic required.",
    "CLI will be a new command in the fabric repository (cmd/configtxcli), not a separate repository.",
    "Developer has familiarity with Hyperledger Fabric architecture and configtx package.",
    "No database or external service dependencies for this work.",
    "Code review and CI/CD pipeline execution time not included in effort estimates."
